{"3587090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Double It", "steam_appid": 3587090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/b0e97881b7c097782b1a7307a382fb10.poster.avif?t=1752253270\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/b0e97881b7c097782b1a7307a382fb10.webm?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/b0e97881b7c097782b1a7307a382fb10.mp4?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Double It!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've entered a high-stakes competition where <strong>only the last one standing</strong> walks away a millionaire. Spin the wheel, stare death in the face, and outsmart the others—because in <i>Double It</i>, luck is just the beginning. Strategy, deception, and bold moves will take you further than fate ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/53b2c56ef3eb6b079b45b7f45ff9dbb0.poster.avif?t=1752253270\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/53b2c56ef3eb6b079b45b7f45ff9dbb0.webm?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/53b2c56ef3eb6b079b45b7f45ff9dbb0.mp4?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do you play Double It?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns spinning the wheel and try to either safely claim the money or take a risk to double it.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a player chooses to double their money, other players can press the red button on the screen if they suspect a bluff.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a player correctly catches someone bluffing, they steal their money. But if they're wrong, they lose their own money.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, the player with the least amount of money is eliminated from the table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why is Double It fun?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in multiplayer or single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join voice chat with other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand out with unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh and immersive experience</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/b0e97881b7c097782b1a7307a382fb10.poster.avif?t=1752253270\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/b0e97881b7c097782b1a7307a382fb10.webm?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/b0e97881b7c097782b1a7307a382fb10.mp4?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Double It!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've entered a high-stakes competition where <strong>only the last one standing</strong> walks away a millionaire. Spin the wheel, stare death in the face, and outsmart the others—because in <i>Double It</i>, luck is just the beginning. Strategy, deception, and bold moves will take you further than fate ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/53b2c56ef3eb6b079b45b7f45ff9dbb0.poster.avif?t=1752253270\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/53b2c56ef3eb6b079b45b7f45ff9dbb0.webm?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/extras/53b2c56ef3eb6b079b45b7f45ff9dbb0.mp4?t=1752253270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do you play Double It?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns spinning the wheel and try to either safely claim the money or take a risk to double it.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a player chooses to double their money, other players can press the red button on the screen if they suspect a bluff.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a player correctly catches someone bluffing, they steal their money. But if they're wrong, they lose their own money.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, the player with the least amount of money is eliminated from the table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why is Double It fun?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in multiplayer or single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join voice chat with other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa